WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.346
Meet Collabify.

00:00:01.396 --> 00:00:06.331
The project workspace where classes and teams plan, build, and finish together.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.234
Make it yours.

00:00:08.284 --> 00:00:12.781
Choose every color: the banner, the navigation, even your status colors.

00:00:12.831 --> 00:00:13.729
Light, or dark.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.770
Two spaces. One for the classroom. One for the workplace.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.996
In the educational space, professors build projects from the syllabus.

00:00:24.046 --> 00:00:27.115
Suggestions name them, and AI drafts the brief.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.181
Then students plan by voice.

00:00:29.231 --> 00:00:33.040
Collabify transcribes the discussion, and drafts the tasks.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.329
Nothing is added until they choose.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.091
The board shows everyone's progress.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:43.261
Files move through drafts, commits, and approval, before they reach Main.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.478
Then the group hands in, and the professor reviews and accepts.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.859
In the work space, pick a template, or start blank.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.941
Add your own fields. Upload and share files.

00:00:54.991 --> 00:00:56.837
Shape the project to your team.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.317
Then set up your team, and every member's position.

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:04.470
Everything, tailored to how you work.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.209
Papers too long? Summarize any file on Main.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.227
Collabify. Work together, build better.
